\title{Notation for conjunction vs disjunction}
\date{2026-01-21T14:48:22Z}
\tag{discrete}
\taxon{Remark}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{The symbols #{\land} and #{\lor} are easy to mix up.  Just remember that
#{\land} looks like a capital "A" for "And", #{\lor} looks like a
capital "V" for "Vote" (a vote is when you choose between
options).}
